sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Authorized VM / NIC control
    participant N as netd
    participant C as Local Cilium API
    M->>N: Own-NIC handoff request
    N->>C: GET endpoint by CEP name
    C-->>N: Identity labels + unique attachment A
    N->>N: Verify VM UID / NIC / role / namespace
    Note over N,C: The reusable name may now refer to B
    N->>C: PATCH unique CNI attachment A
    C-->>N: State outcome for A, or refusal if gone
    N-->>M: Bounded result
